    {
      "id": "p0064-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because the entertainment localization industry relies so heavily on agencies, middlemen, paperwork, and tight deadlines, creators and localizers are often separated by a wall of bureaucracy. This separation makes it difficult for both sides to communicate with each other. And even when bureaucracy isn't an issue, some creators simply don't care to be involved in the localization process. Either way, it's rare to see a creator actively participate in a localization project.",
        "raw": "Because the entertainment localization industry relies so heavily on agencies,\nmiddlemen, paperwork, and tight deadlines, creators and localizers are often\nseparated by a wall of bureaucracy. This separation makes it difficult for both\nsides to communicate with each other. And even when bureaucracy isn't an\nissue, some creators simply don't care to be involved in the localization process.\nEither way, it's rare to see a creator actively participate in a localization project.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29630149,
          0.08998571,
          0.90749771,
          0.19395714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29424688,
          0.08927143,
          0.9114747,
          0.19502857
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          2,
          3,
          4,
          5,
          6,
          7
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "娱乐本地化行业十分依赖代理机构、中间人、文书流程和紧迫的期限，创作者与本地化人员之间常隔着一道程序性的高墙，难以直接沟通。即使没有这类阻碍，有些创作者也根本不想参与。无论哪种情况，创作者积极参与本地化项目都很少见。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29679989,
          0.08855714,
          0.90944043,
          0.19752857
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify",
        "auto_height": true,
        "limit_bottom": 0.3221428571428571,
        "snap_to_guides": true,
        "resize_anchor": "left"
      },
      "calibration": {
