      "review_issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0064-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In Undertale's case, Toby was directly involved with the English-to-Japanese localization process from the very start. He provided 8-4 with all of his development files and copious translation notes ahead of time. He remained in constant contact with the team via e-mail, answered question after question, asked question after question, and even met with the localization team in Japan more than once.",
        "raw": "In Underta/e's case, Toby was directly involved with the English-to-Japanese\nlocalization process from the very start. He provided 8-4 with all of his\ndevelopment files and copious translation notes ahead of time. He remained\nin constant contact with the team via e-mail, answered question after question,\nasked question after question, and even met with the localization team in\nJapan more than once.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29628115,
          0.20867857,
          0.90231032,
          0.31199286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29424688,
          0.20796429,
          0.9114747,
          0.31306429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          8,
          9,
          10,
          11,
          12,
          13
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Undertale 则不同，Toby 从一开始就直接参与英译日本地化。他提前把全部开发文件和大量翻译说明交给 8-4，始终通过邮件与团队保持联系，回答一个又一个问题，也提出一个又一个问题，还不止一次到日本与团队见面。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
