    {
      "id": "p0064-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "As the localization neared completion, Toby also brought in outside help to critique key parts of the localization and explain their Japanese nuances to him. Toby then sent these critiques to 8-4 to improve the final script before release.",
        "raw": "As the localization neared completion, Toby also brought in outside help to\ncritique key parts of the localization and explain their Japanese nuances to him.\nToby then sent these critiques to 8-4 to improve the final script before release.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29729829,
          0.63739286,
          0.90944043,
          0.68689286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29424688,
          0.63667857,
          0.9114747,
          0.68796429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          20,
          21,
          22
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "接近完成时，Toby 还请外部人员评价关键部分，并向他解释日语里的细微意味。随后，他把这些意见发给 8-4，让团队在发行前改进最终稿。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
