    {
      "id": "p0064-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In short, although he's understandably not listed as a member of the localization staff, Toby undeniably played a major part in Undertale's Japanese localization.",
        "raw": "In short, although he's understandably not listed as a member of the\nlocalization staff, Toby undeniably played a major part in Underta/e's Japanese\nlocalization.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29961735,
          0.70229286,
          0.89833332,
          0.75079286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29424688,
          0.70157857,
          0.9114747,
          0.75186429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          23,
          24,
          25
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "因此，虽然他没有列入本地化人员名单——这也可以理解——Toby 无疑在 Undertale 的日语本地化中起了重要作用。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
