    {
      "id": "p0064-b007",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "On a side note, sometime near the localization's release, Toby mentioned to me that he'd met with the translator at least once before and that they'd discussed localization concerns in person. He later told me that he was genuinely impressed with her work and that she really \"got\" his style. was surprised - it's rare for entertainment translators and creators to ever meet at all, much less be on the same wavelength!",
        "raw": "On a side note, sometime near the localization's release, Toby mentioned\nto me that he'd met with the translator at least once before and that\nthey'd discussed localization concerns in person. He later told me that he\nwas genuinely impressed with her work and that she really \"got\" his style.\nwas surprised - it's rare for entertainment translators and creators to ever\nmeet at all, much less be on the same wavelength!",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.31741721,
          0.77795,
          0.87887554,
          0.86713571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.31609493,
          0.77723571,
          0.88019781,
          0.86820714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          26,
          27,
          28,
          29,
          30,
          31
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "顺便说一句，接近译版发行时，Toby 告诉我，他至少已与译者见过一次面，当面讨论了本地化问题。后来他又说，译者的成果确实让他佩服，她真的“懂”他的风格。我很惊讶：娱乐译者和创作者能见到面就已少见，更别说如此合拍了！",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
